    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Annihilation is an epic turn-based war game with unprecedented freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-form building contruction and tens of unit\u00a0types grant unlimited tactical possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-unit control and\u00a0massive super units bring the battle to an epic level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weld powerfull skills from Titans and enhance units with unique abilites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Freeform Base Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your tactics without the limit from map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position factories anywhere and destroy enemy with gaint artillery battery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/601555868e79824b223ef9c1f30062d0.poster.avif?t=1751175336\" width=490 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/601555868e79824b223ef9c1f30062d0.webm?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/601555868e79824b223ef9c1f30062d0.mp4?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Huge\u00a0Arsenal of\u00a0Combat Units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command 70+ distinct units and buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Troops come with different\u00a0chassis types and irreplaceable battlefield roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/6cc1a9516540c014004ea8c941c79932.poster.avif?t=1751175336\" width=490 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/6cc1a9516540c014004ea8c941c79932.webm?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/6cc1a9516540c014004ea8c941c79932.mp4?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Multi-Unit Control</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate massive armies effortlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Box-select multi-units or double-click for type-specific selection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/52f7087db6c54af7da803998b49d6cad.poster.avif?t=1751175336\" width=490 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/52f7087db6c54af7da803998b49d6cad.webm?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/52f7087db6c54af7da803998b49d6cad.mp4?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Command Mega Units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convert economic supremacy into battlefield annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from heavy armored tank, extreme-range artillery or\u00a0multi-target missile spider.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/ebd7675af038f208fb7b940fea8f5bf4.poster.avif?t=1751175336\" width=490 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/ebd7675af038f208fb7b940fea8f5bf4.webm?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/ebd7675af038f208fb7b940fea8f5bf4.mp4?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Lend Power From Titans</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link with Titans and gain access to battle skills and\u00a0troop-enhancing passive abilites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order direct firepower from sky or reactiave your troops for second attack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/249ef0c107c9f91219de205093354535.poster.avif?t=1751175336\" width=492 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/249ef0c107c9f91219de205093354535.webm?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/249ef0c107c9f91219de205093354535.mp4?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 30-Mission Campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Fully Custom Skirmish Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Powerful Map Editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Share maps with Steam Workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Annihilation is an epic turn-based war game with unprecedented freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-form building contruction and tens of unit\u00a0types grant unlimited tactical possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-unit control and\u00a0massive super units bring the battle to an epic level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weld powerfull skills from Titans and enhance units with unique abilites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Freeform Base Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your tactics without the limit from map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Position factories anywhere and destroy enemy with gaint artillery battery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/601555868e79824b223ef9c1f30062d0.poster.avif?t=1751175336\" width=490 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/601555868e79824b223ef9c1f30062d0.webm?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/601555868e79824b223ef9c1f30062d0.mp4?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Huge\u00a0Arsenal of\u00a0Combat Units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command 70+ distinct units and buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Troops come with different\u00a0chassis types and irreplaceable battlefield roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/6cc1a9516540c014004ea8c941c79932.poster.avif?t=1751175336\" width=490 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite