bd7675af038f208fb7b940fea8f5bf4.mp4?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25b6 Lend Power From Titans</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link with Titans and gain access to battle skills and\u00a0troop-enhancing passive abilites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order direct firepower from sky or reactiave your troops for second attack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/249ef0c107c9f91219de205093354535.poster.avif?t=1751175336\" width=492 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/249ef0c107c9f91219de205093354535.webm?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3345550/extras/249ef0c107c9f91219de205093354535.mp4?t=1751175336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 30-Mission Campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Fully Custom Skirmish Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Powerful Map Editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2713 Share maps with Steam Workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
